  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Icod.Terminal 1.4.0 adds typed, bounded Kitty OSC 99 desktop notifications while preserving the existing OSC 9 and OSC 777 notification APIs and all stable 1.x contracts. The new surface provides send/update by stable identifier, explicit close, filtering metadata, focus policy, occasion, urgency, expiration, sounds, icon-name lookup, bounded PNG/JPEG/GIF icon transfer/cache identifiers, plus correlated capability and alive-notification queries. Text and metadata use strict UTF-8 with Base64 where defined by Kitty, payloads are automatically chunked to the protocol's 4096 encoded-byte limit, and queries reuse the authoritative terminal response router. Buttons and unsolicited activation/close reports are deliberately deferred pending a separate TerminalEvent routing contract. Full notes: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.4.0/docs/releases/1.4.0.md ; compatibility: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.4.0/docs/Compatibility-and-Versioning.md",
